OL,3,GNEWSARiverside apartment project given
OL,4,Ago-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to build nearly 240 apartments
OL,7,Fnext to the River Thames in Reading has
OL,8,Fbeen unanimously approved.
OL,10,FThe Norman Place office building in
OL,11,FVastern Road, close to the town's train
OL,12,Fstation, has been unused since 2020
OL,13,Fafter its last occupant, Covea
OL,14,FInsurance, left.
OL,16,FThat will be demolished to make way for
OL,17,FWaterfront Square, which was approved
OL,18,Fby Reading Borough Council at a meeting
OL,19,Fon Wednesday. A total of 236 flats will
OL,20,Fbe built there.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
